<template>
    <heading>Startup code</heading>
    <keywords>
        <li>startup</li>
        <li>module</li>
        <li>command</li>
        <li>dialog</li>
    </keywords>
    <section data-lp5-kind="explanation">
        <p>This module script runs after the browser has parsed the document,
        so the dialog templates are available. The earlier classic script has
        already initialized <code>window.LP5.controller</code>.</p>
        <p>Startup dispatches a <code>ModalDialog</code> command naming the
        Select/Create Project dialog. The modal dialog operation receives the
        command; its current stub does not yet display the dialog.</p>
    </section>
    <section data-lp5-kind="code">
        <name>Startup code</name>
        <code><![CDATA[
<script type="module">
    window.LP5.controller.dispatch({
        name: "ModalDialog",
        dialogName: "LP5-Dialog-SelectCreateProject"
    });
</script>
]]></code>
    </section>
</template>
